      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SKYBELLA (5) comes here off a last-start win at this track over 1720m, scoring by 2.5 metres. Talented and has plenty of upside. Facing a tougher assignment but she is capable of running a big race. DISTANT SUN (3) was in the money at Kilmore two runs ago before finishing seventh at his latest appearance over 2240m here, beaten 22 metres. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Stepping up a level this time but on his best form he is good enough to take this out. FARROKH (10) is in the mix following a respectable third at his most recent appearance over 1720m at this venue. One for the multiples. SKY FLAIR (8) is worth plenty of thought off a last-start win by a nose at this course over 2240m. Can trouble the judge with any luck in running.",
